\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Retained work and retained service require coordinated decisions. (a) The predeclared 24-speaker stratum: each cell sums three eight-speaker cohorts' frontier withdrawals and audio coverage meeting display 2~s/certified 8~s deadlines over 714.110~s per arm. The four matrix arms and our separate Alternative joint positive control (15 runs total) fail whole-run D2. (b) Final native matched and resident banks each offer 66.340~s per policy on four existing sources. Stacks separate timely same-frontier whole-text agreement, other timely coverage and uncovered audio; text agreement is retrospective against selected model output. Unlabelled tails are the remainder to 100\%, with rounded labels. Passes count matched trials or resident requests meeting display P99 $\leq 2$~s and certified P99 $\leq 8$~s.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:main_evidence}{{3}{7}{Retained work and retained service require coordinated decisions. (a) The predeclared 24-speaker stratum: each cell sums three eight-speaker cohorts' frontier withdrawals and audio coverage meeting display 2~s/certified 8~s deadlines over 714.110~s per arm. The four matrix arms and our separate Alternative joint positive control (15 runs total) fail whole-run D2. (b) Final native matched and resident banks each offer 66.340~s per policy on four existing sources. Stacks separate timely same-frontier whole-text agreement, other timely coverage and uncovered audio; text agreement is retrospective against selected model output. Unlabelled tails are the remainder to 100\%, with rounded labels. Passes count matched trials or resident requests meeting display P99 $\leq 2$~s and certified P99 $\leq 8$~s}{figure.3}{}}
